The images of the character koharu were created with OpenAI's image
generation model and then edited and composited with tools/character/build.py.
The source images in art/ keep the generator's embedded metadata.

The drawings of a marimo moss ball are original to this project. They
cover the tray icons app/src-tauri/icons/tray-*.png drawn by
tools/tray_icon.py, and the application icons icon.icns, icon.ico, icon.png,
32x32.png, 128x128.png and 128x128@2x.png in app/src-tauri/icons/, which
show the moss ball in a water tank and are drawn by tools/app_icon.py.

